    "text": "I labelled 7 columns and sent them to report_profile for job 1.\n\n- **npi**: identifier, PHI (it identifies a provider; I marked it PHI because it is unclear whether it links to a person outside the platform).\n- **provider_first_name** and **provider_last_name**: name, PHI.\n- **taxonomy_code**, **practice_state**, **accepting_new_patients**: code, not PHI.\n- **effective_date**: date, not PHI (it is the provider record's effective date, not a patient's date of birth).\n\n`profile_file` failed because the feed has no contract yet, so the labels rest on `diff_schema` alone.",
